 "name_en": "Returnables Processing (BDW)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Returnables Processing (BDW)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio7e920217f5af40f3bb7417553e920a83\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7e920217f5af40f3bb7417553e920a83__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables the shipping of standard pallets and their return. When you create a standard sales order, the delivery is automatically created based on this sales order. During the picking and shipping steps of this process, a pallet (returnable packaging) is added to the delivery. During the billing process, pallets can also be returned to manufacturers using a pallet return order with pallet return delivery and goods receipt, or a pallet return delivery without reference and goods receipt.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">If customers do not return pallets, you can issue debit memo requests. Triggered by billing, the system issues debit memos based on such debit memo requests. Once this has been carried out, you can synchronize the consignment stock quantity and value, and then post a manual goods issue for the unreturned pallet.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7e920217f5af40f3bb7417553e920a83__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create sales order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create delivery</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute picking</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Add returnable packaging to deliveries</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create returnable packaging return order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods receipt for returnable packaging</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Debit unreturned packaging</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods issue for unreturned packaging</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7e920217f5af40f3bb7417553e920a83__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Consists of the management of returnables using the ERP returnable packaging logistics function</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Track returnables</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>可退货处理 (BDW)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio7e920217f5af40f3bb7417553e920a83\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7e920217f5af40f3bb7417553e920a83__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目支持标准托盘及其退货的装运。创建标准销售订单时，将基于此销售订单自动创建交货。在此流程的拣配和装运步骤期间，托盘（可回收包装）将添加到交货中。在开票流程中，还可以使用具有托盘退货交货和收货的托盘退货订单，或无参考和收货的托盘退货交货将托盘退回给制造商。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">如果客户不退回托盘，则可以发出借项凭证请求。通过开票触发，系统根据此类借项凭证请求发出借项凭证。执行此操作后，您可以同步寄售库存数量和价值，然后过账未退回托盘的手动发货。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7e920217f5af40f3bb7417553e920a83__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建销售订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建交货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行拣配</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将可回收包装添加到交货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建可回收包装退货订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账可回收包装的收货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">借记未退回包装</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账未退回包装的发货</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio7e920217f5af40f3bb7417553e920a83__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">包括使用 ERP 可回收包装物流功能管理可退货品</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">跟踪可退货物</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
